# T_SCRE: the help of the item form's tabs and of the service record
# form: item 1's Parts tab (PARTS), its Service tab (SERVICE), one of
# its service records (SERVREC) and its Loans tab (LOANS).
K ENTER ALT-C P F1
S HPARTS
K ESC ESC ALT-C S F1
S HSERV
K ESC ENTER F1
S HSERVREC
K ESC ESC ESC ALT-C A F1
S HLOANS
K ESC ESC ESC ESC
